Apache-2.0. raccess does not copy jetdb's source; it uses it as a library.

The test corpus in fixtures/jackcess/ consists of the test databases from
Jackcess (https://github.com/jahlborn/jackcess), Copyright 2005 Health Market
Science, Inc. and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
It is fetched by scripts/fetch-fixtures.sh rather than distributed here, and
carries its own LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt when present.

Jackcess source was consulted as format documentation while planning this
project; the file format constants it documents are recorded in
docs/prior-art.md. No Jackcess code is reproduced in raccess.
